        "jsCode": "// Get the Chart.js config from the AI response\nconst chartConfig = items[0].json.output;\n\n// Encode the config to embed in the QuickChart URL\nconst encodedConfig = encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(chartConfig));\n\n// Append QuickChart background color via the 'bkg' query parameter\nconst chartUrl = `https://quickchart.io/chart?c=${encodedConfig}&bkg=white`;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      chartUrl\n    }\n  }\n];\n"
